---
# Pre-specification

Answers to the pre-analysis form. Closed answers are shown in English; open
answers are quoted verbatim, in the client's language ({{ language }}).
{% for section in sections %}

## {{ section.title }}
{% for field in section.fields %}

### {{ field.title }}

{% if not field.answer %}
Not provided.
{% elif field.answer.quote %}
{{ field.answer.quote | quote }}
{% elif field.answer.list %}
{% for item in field.answer.list %}
- {{ item }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
{{ field.answer.text }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}

## Open points

{% if open_points.length %}
{% for point in open_points %}
- {{ point }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
None.
{% endif %}
